  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Past the guest halt stele in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Fang Yuan finds a copy sealed in the crystal wall and exchanges close to ten spring egg Gu for it. His Four Arm Wind King used Wind Overlord Gu and Tyrant Strength Gu as a substitute at less than half the effect, so this Gu lets him raise that killer move. Sky Strength Gu is already extinct by then. Earth, fire, water, wind, and similar strength Gu still circulate, often away from that original pairing.",
        "chapters": [
          560
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "move_four_arm_wind_king",
          "gu_wind_overlord_gu",
          "gu_tyrant_strength_gu",
          "gu_sky_strength_gu",
          "gu_strength_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan returns to Hu Immortal blessed land from the northern plains, this Gu remains among the mortal Gu that form Myriad Self.",
        "chapters": [
          650
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "remaining-mortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Borrow Strength Gu stays listed beside rank four All-out Effort Gu (the second aperture’s vital Gu) and Bitter Strength Gu and other strength Gu. Those Gu form the foundation of Myriad Self, which let him clinch victory inside the wind veil of assimilation.",
        "chapters": [
          650
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "remaining-mortal-gu",
